<title>BRAZIL: Brazil March 14 coffee regs 3.35mln bags March-May.</title>
<headline>Brazil March 14 coffee regs 3.35mln bags March-May.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil coffee export registrations as of March 14 totaled 3.35 million bags for March, April and May, according to the March 25 bulletin of the Rio de Janeiro Coffee Center.</p>
<p>A breakdown by month was as follows.</p>
<p> MONTH     REGISTRATIONS IN 60-KG BAGS</p>
<p> March		  1,628,338</p>
<p> April		  1,106,862</p>
<p> May			613,049</p>
<p> TOTAL		  3,348,249</p>
<p>((Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
